{%- comment -%}
  About · section divider. Opens from the centre when it scrolls in (assets/hoa-about.js,
  [data-hoa-ab-rule]). Each divider wears a different pattern so none repeats down the page:
    heritage (default)  Hyderabad's monuments (Charminar, a Qutub Shahi tomb, Golconda Fort,
                        Mecca Masjid) standing on the Qutub Shahi arcade
    cross | knot        a single row of a Deccani lattice (snippets/hoa-qutub-pattern.liquid)
  Params: variant.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign rule_variant = variant | default: 'heritage' -%}
<div class="hoa-wrap"><span class="hoa-ab-rule hoa-ab-rule--{{ rule_variant }}" aria-hidden="true" data-hoa-ab-rule>{%- render 'hoa-qutub-pattern', variant: rule_variant -%}</span></div>
